  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EL VALAH LIVESTOCK PRODUCTION AND MARKETING CAPACITY BUILDING</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The cooperative wants to improve the living conditions of its members by creating value chains and promoting livestock sectors (milk, meat, fodder); changing production mindsets; Contribute to the regeneration of endangered fodder species; the reduction of CO2 by promoting renewable energies (solar, wind) in the field of water pumping, domestic lighting; promote cultivation at three levels (date palms, fruit trees and non-timber forest products).</narrative>
  </description>
